WEBVTT

00:05:58.280 --> 00:06:01.160
which is what net-zero means,

00:06:01.184 --> 00:06:06.006
takes us through 10 percent
carbon capture in 2030,

00:06:06.030 --> 00:06:07.819
50 percent in 2040,

00:06:07.843 --> 00:06:10.153
100 percent in 2050.

00:06:10.690 --> 00:06:12.176
To put that in context,

00:06:12.200 --> 00:06:16.643
we are currently capturing
and storing less than 0.1 percent.

00:06:17.490 --> 00:06:18.746
So don't get me wrong,

00:06:18.770 --> 00:06:22.010
decarbonizing fossil fuels
is not going to be easy.

00:06:22.374 --> 00:06:26.986
It's going to mean building
a carbon dioxide disposal industry

00:06:27.010 --> 00:06:30.843
comparable in size
to today's oil and gas industry.